    "title": "MyByrider",
    "description": "Welcome to the Byrider App!  This free App allows you to improve your ownership experience of the vehicle you purchased from a Byrider dealer. You can manage and make payments for your CNAC account.   The app allows you to do the following:\r\n\r\nAbility to register vehicle retail installment and related contracts \r\nAdd, remove payment types such as debit card or bank account\r\nSet, change or remove a default payment account\r\nUse pay now to pay all accounts due at once or pay individual accounts\r\nPay current balance or minimum contractual payment\r\nMake ad hoc payments with enterable amount\r\nView Payment History\r\nView active accounts\r\nView account Balance\r\nView Auto Pay future Scheduled payments\r\nView Next payment Due Date",
